# Skyseer's Chariot taxes every activated ability of a source with the chosen name, a mana ability too (CR 605.1a: it is not
# excepted, as Anointed Peacekeeper's is). Bot1 names Mox Jet. With every other Mox tapped, Jet's {T}: Add {B} costs {2} more and is
# refused (CR 602.2b, `Mana: short`); on turn 3 it is activated by paying {2} from Mox Pearl and Mox Sapphire, leaving only {B} in the
# pool. The Chariot is not named, so Grizzly Bears crews it for nothing: nothing is tapped for it (the pool stays empty).

